  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\Delta=0 \\Rightarrow\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}2 & \\lambda & 3 \\\\ 3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 5 & \\mu\\end{array}\\right|=0$<br/>$\\Rightarrow 2(2 \\mu+5)+\\lambda(-4-3 \\mu)+3(7)=0$<br/>$\\Rightarrow 4 \\mu-3 \\lambda \\mu-4 \\lambda+31=0$   ...(1)<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\Delta_3=0 \\Rightarrow\\left|\\begin{array}{lll}<br/>2 & \\lambda & 5 \\\\\n3 & 2 & 7 \\\\\n4 & 5 & 9<br/>\\end{array}\\right|=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 2(-17)+\\lambda(1)+5(7)=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\lambda=-1<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>from equation (1)<br/>$4 \\mu+3 \\mu+4+31=0 \\Rightarrow \\mu=-5$<br/>$\\therefore \\lambda^2+\\mu^2=26$",
    "image": null
  },
